---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About">
  <article class="wrap narrow prose" style="padding-top:3rem">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Why this site exists</h1>
    <p>
      I spent my career running large-scale cloud operations. Now I build physical things: circuit
      boards, speakers, home automation, shop tools. I lean heavily on AI along the way, as a design
      partner for schematics, layout and code.
    </p>
    <p>
      Most build write-ups show the finished result. These projects are documented from the first
      requirement to the final install, including the mistakes, so you can follow the same path and
      build your own.
    </p>
    <h2>How the projects are documented</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Chapters</strong> follow the build in order, each with its own video.</li>
      <li><strong>Every decision has a source:</strong> datasheets, reference designs and standards are linked.</li>
      <li><strong>Design files</strong> go on GitHub once each board has been built and tested.</li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</Base>
